# LeakSanitizer suppressions for tools/check-all.sh.
#
# fontconfig keeps a small, fixed allocation from its XML configuration parser for the life of the
# process (FcInitBringUptoDate -> config parsing). ui_fonts.cpp deliberately never calls FcFini
# between queries, because unloading would leak and rebuild the configuration each time. Only
# allocations whose stack passes through libfontconfig are suppressed; leaks in project code still
# fail.
leak:libfontconfig.so
